  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_roshan_1_0": "Each Attack Restores Health: 10/20/30",
    "modifier_roshan_1_1": "Each Attack Restores Health: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/20/30",
    "modifier_roshan_1_2": "Each Attack Restores Health: 10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b>/30",
    "modifier_roshan_1_3": "Each Attack Restores Health: 10/20/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_2_0": "Bash Damage Increase: 150%/200% of Strength",
    "modifier_roshan_2_1": "Bash Damage Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>150%</font></b>/200% of Strength",
    "modifier_roshan_2_2": "Bash Damage Increase: 150%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200%</font></b> of Strength",
    "modifier_roshan_3_0": "Bash can be activated. \n\n The hero accelerates and runs in the selected direction. When colliding with enemies, uses the Bash ability on them. Can be stopped at any time with the cancel command. Removes the limit on maximum movement speed during the charge. \n\n Increased Movement Speed ​​during Bash Charge: 200 \n Maximum Charge Duration: 3 sec. \n Radius: 300 \n Cooldown: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_3_1": "Bash can be activated. \n\n The hero accelerates and runs in the selected direction. When colliding with enemies, uses the Bash ability on them. Can be stopped at any time with the cancel command. Removes the limit on maximum movement speed during the charge. \n\n Increased Movement Speed ​​during Bash Charge: <b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b> \n Maximum Charge Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> sec. \n Radius: 300 \n Cooldown: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_4_0": "Increased Movement Speed ​​during Bash Run: 200/400",
    "modifier_roshan_4_1": "Increased Movement Speed ​​during Bash Run: <b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b>/400",
    "modifier_roshan_4_2": "Increased Movement Speed ​​during Bash Run: 200/<b><font color='#eabe10'>400</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_5_0": "Increases Attack Speed ​​by 8/12/16 for every 10% of Missing Health.",
    "modifier_roshan_5_1": "Increases Attack Speed ​​by <b><font color='#eabe10'>8</font></b>/12/16 for every <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b> of Missing Health.",
    "modifier_roshan_5_2": "Increases Attack Speed ​​by 8/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12</font></b>/16 for every <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b> of Missing Health.",
    "modifier_roshan_5_3": "Increases Attack Speed ​​by 8/12/<b><font color='#eabe10'>16</font></b> for every <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b> of Missing Health.",
    "modifier_roshan_6_0": "If Current Health is less than 20%, then: \n\n Reduction of Total Damage Received: 6%/12%/18%",
    "modifier_roshan_6_1": "If Current Health is less than <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>, then: \n\n Reduction of Total Damage Received: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>/12%/18%",
    "modifier_roshan_6_2": "If Current Health is less than <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>, then: \n\n Reduction of Total Damage Received: 6%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b>/18%",
    "modifier_roshan_6_3": "If Current Health is less than <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>, then: \n\n Reduction of Total Damage Received: 6%/12%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>18%</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_7_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Immortal Throw. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Roar of Retribution \n\n The hero lets out a roar audible across the entire map, dealing magical damage to all units in the radius and increasing the damage they take. Grants unobstructed vision at the cast location. \n\n Damage per Second: 75% of Strength \n Incoming Damage Increase: 15% \n Effect Duration: 7 sec. \n Radius: 1200 \n Cooldown: 20 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_7_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Immortal Throw. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Roar of Retribution</font></b> \n\n The hero lets out a roar audible across the entire map, dealing magical damage to all units in the radius and increasing the damage they take. Grants unobstructed vision at the cast location. \n\n Damage per Second: <b><font color='#eabe10'>75%</font></b> of Strength \n Incoming Damage Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b> \n Effect Duration: 7 sec. \n Radius: 1200 \n Cooldown: 20 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_8_0": "Using Items increases Attack Speed: 30 \n\n Effect Duration: 4/8 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_8_1": "Using Items increases Attack Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> \n\n Effect Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>/8 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_8_2": "Using Items increases Attack Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> \n\n Effect Duration: 4/<b><font color='#eabe10'>8</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_9_0": "Increased Bash Chance: 3%/6%",
    "modifier_roshan_9_1": "Increased Bash Chance: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b>/6%",
    "modifier_roshan_9_2": "Increased Bash Chance: 3%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>6%</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_10_0": "New Active Ability: Roshpit \n\n After a short preparation, the hero summons a stone lair that blocks enemy movement and limits their vision. Increases the hero's movement speed inside the lair.\n\n Movement Speed: 30% \n Duration: 6 sec. \n Cast Range: 400 \n Radius: 550 \n Cooldown: 30 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_10_1": "New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Roshpit</font></b> \n\n After a short preparation, the hero summons a stone lair that blocks enemy movement and limits their vision. Increases the hero's movement speed inside the lair.\n\n Movement Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b> \n Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>6</font></b> sec. \n Cast Range: 400 \n Radius: 550 \n Cooldown: 30 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_11_0": "Enemies near the walls inside the lair are Stunned: 1/2/3 sec. \n\n Spell Damage: 5%/10%/15%",
    "modifier_roshan_11_1": "Enemies near the walls inside the lair are Stunned: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2/3 sec. \n\n Spell Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5%</font></b>/10%/15%",
    "modifier_roshan_11_2": "Enemies near the walls inside the lair are Stunned: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3 sec. \n\n Spell Damage: 5%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/15%",
    "modifier_roshan_11_3": "Enemies near the walls inside the lair are Stunned: 1/2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> sec. \n\n Spell Damage: 5%/10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_12_0": "Using Items has a 100% chance to apply Bash to a random enemy within a radius of 800 \n\n The duration of this Bash is reduced by 2x. Prioritizes heroes.",
    "modifier_roshan_12_1": "Using Items has a <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> chance to apply Bash to a random enemy within a radius of <b><font color='#eabe10'>800</font></b> \n\n The duration of this Bash is reduced by 2x. Prioritizes heroes.",
    "modifier_roshan_13_0": "Reduced Item Cooldown: 10%/15%/20%",
    "modifier_roshan_13_1": "Reduced Item Cooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/15%/20%",
    "modifier_roshan_13_2": "Reduced Item Cooldown: 10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b>/20%",
    "modifier_roshan_13_3": "Reduced Item Cooldown: 10%/15%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_14_0": "Base Attack Time: 1.6",
    "modifier_roshan_14_1": "Base Attack Time: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1.6</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_15_0": "Slam Damage Increase: 80%/120% of Intelligence",
    "modifier_roshan_15_1": "Slam Damage Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>80%</font></b>/120% of Intelligence",
    "modifier_roshan_15_2": "Slam Damage Increase: 80%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>120%</font></b> of Intelligence",
    "modifier_roshan_16_0": "New Passive Ability: Eat Roshefort \n\n Permanently grants a barrier that absorbs 500 damage. The barrier is restored at a rate of 2 units per second per 1 hero level.",
    "modifier_roshan_16_1": "New Passive Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Eat Roshefort</font></b> \n\n Permanently grants a barrier that absorbs <b><font color='#eabe10'>500</font></b> damage. The barrier is restored at a rate of <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> units per second per <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b> hero level.",
    "modifier_roshan_17_0": "If you have not taken any Health damage in the last 3 sec., then: \n\n Reduce Slam Cooldown: 2.5/5 sec. \n Spell Damage: 10%/20%",
    "modifier_roshan_17_1": "If you have not taken any Health damage in the last 3 sec., then: \n\n Reduce Slam Cooldown: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2.5</font></b>/5 sec. \n Spell Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/20%",
    "modifier_roshan_17_2": "If you have not taken any Health damage in the last 3 sec., then: \n\n Reduce Slam Cooldown: 2.5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b> sec. \n Spell Damage: 10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_18_0": "Immortal Throw Cooldown Reduction: 10/20/30 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_18_1": "Immortal Throw Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/20/30 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_18_2": "Immortal Throw Cooldown Reduction: 10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b>/30 sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_18_3": "Immortal Throw Cooldown Reduction: 10/20/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_roshan_19_0": "Slam is applied instantly. \n\n Slam Radius Increase: 100/200/300",
    "modifier_roshan_19_1": "Slam is applied <b><font color='#eabe10'>instantly</font></b>. \n\n Slam Radius Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b>/200/300",
    "modifier_roshan_19_2": "Slam is applied <b><font color='#eabe10'>instantly</font></b>. \n\n Slam Radius Increase: 100/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200</font></b>/300",
    "modifier_roshan_19_3": "Slam is applied <b><font color='#eabe10'>instantly</font></b>. \n\n Slam Radius Increase: 100/200/<b><font color='#eabe10'>300</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_20_0": "Spell Block reflects enemy spells. \n\n Evasion: 0%/14%",
    "modifier_roshan_20_1": "Spell Block <b><font color='#eabe10'>reflects</font></b> enemy spells. \n\n Evasion: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0%</font></b>/14%",
    "modifier_roshan_20_2": "Spell Block <b><font color='#eabe10'>reflects</font></b> enemy spells. \n\n Evasion: 0%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>14%</font></b>",
    "modifier_roshan_21_0": "New Active Item: Cheese \n\n Instantly restores health and mana. The next Slam will deal 3 times more damage. The item can be sold for 500 gold. \n\n Restores Health: 1000 \n Restores Mana: 1000 \n Cooldown: 25 sec. \n\n Intellect: 7%",
    "modifier_roshan_21_1": "New Active Item: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Cheese</font></b> \n\n Instantly restores health and mana. The next Slam will deal <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> times more damage. The item can be sold for 500 gold. \n\n Restores Health: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1000</font></b> \n Restores Mana: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1000</font></b> \n Cooldown: 25 sec. \n\n Intellect: <b><font color='#eabe10'>7%</font></b>"
  },
